  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joint Policy Review Group linked Budget Support for Solomon Islands</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia&#x2019;s contribution to Solomon Islands&#x2019; World Bank-coordinated Joint Policy Reform Group (JPRG) for 2023-2024 financial year. The JPRG is a multi-donor process (AUS, WB, ADB, JPN, JICA, NZ, EU, SIG ) which supports Solomon Islands&#x2019; efforts to institutionalise sound Public Financial Management (PFM) and administration, as well as to promote sustainable and inclusive economic growth over the medium to long term. Moreover, it provides a mechanism to implement and review progress against priority economic and PFM reforms through a Policy Reform Matrix (PRM).</narrative>
  </description>
